l", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information, involving apologies, thanks, suggestions and invitations in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le09ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Apologizing and Responding to Apologies"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<br>When you feel badly about something you do, you apologize and say you are sorry. You can use the Simple Present tense. You can also add an explanation. Some expressions of apology are:<br>  <span class=\"italic\"><br><ul><li>I'm (so/very/terribly) sorry!</li> <li>I apologize \u2026 </li> <li>We would like to apologize ...</li></ul> </span>  <br>To respond to an apology, you can use these expressions:<br>  <span class=\"italic\"> <br><ul><li>No problem!</li> <li>No worries!</li> <li>That's all right.</li> <li>Don't worry about it.</li> <li>No harm done.</li></ul> </span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "delay"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when something does not happen when it should "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a delay. The plane will leave in two hours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear at the airport."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "notification"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "information about something. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is an important notification. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "announcement "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an important statement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please wait for further announcements from officials."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to inform"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to officially tell someone about something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We regret to inform you that there is delay."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inconvenience"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "problems caused by something which affects people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We apologize for any inconvenience caused."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "as soon as possible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in the least amount of time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are working to fix this as soon as possible."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "patience "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the ability to continue waiting without becoming upset"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We thank you for your patience."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "air traffic"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the movement of airplanes in the sky"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are experiencing a delay because of high air traffic."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to resolve "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to find a way to solve a problem "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are working to resolve this issue."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "matter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "issue; situation to deal with"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We want to resolve this matter ASAP."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob10aud10"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Expressing what You Want and Would Like to Do"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When expressing something you want you begin the sentence with <span class = \"italic\">I want</span>, or<span class = \"italic\"> I would like</span>.<br/>Both are used when expressing a want, but we consider <span class = \"italic\">I want</span> to be informal, and <span class = \"italic\">I would like</span> to be more formal."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want..\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"say sorry for what happened <br/>to get some coffee.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like..\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to apologize for the delay. <br/> to walk around the airport.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are at the airport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There is a delay with a flight."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an announcement (5-7 lines) to inform the passengers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Apologize for the delay."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice reading your announcement aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write an announcement about a delay in my flight."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I apologize for the delay."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice reading my announcement aloud."}]}], "type": "sena"}